OL,3,GNEWSAThe group aiming to keep the
OL,4,Ashowmanship of cinema alive
OL,5,
OL,6,F"You can hold up a piece of film to the
OL,7,Flight and you can actually see the
OL,8,Fpictures on it.
OL,10,F"Young people really enjoy that," Bill
OL,11,FLawrence explains.
OL,13,FHe's talking to me ahead of a special
OL,14,Fevent which will see decades of cinema
OL,15,Fhistory on show to the public.
OL,17,FThe movie buff is vice-chair of the
OL,18,FProjected Picture Trust (PPT), which
OL,19,Faims to preserve the magic of cinema
OL,20,Fand showcase the technology and
OL,21,Ftechniques behind the silver screen.
